<programme start="20261015070000 +0000" stop="20261015100000 +0000" channel="ACCN ESPN"><title lang="en">College Football</title><sub-title lang="en">Florida State at Louisville</sub-title><desc lang="en">Louisville (2-3) hosts Florida State (3-2) in a Week 6 ACC game. The Seminoles have won two straight after beating the Cavaliers 38-7 behind five Ashton Daniels TDs, while the Cardinals lost 31-28 to the Wolfpack despite efforts by Lincoln Kienholz.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191261_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261015100000 +0000" stop="20261015130000 +0000" channel="ACCN ESPN"><title lang="en">College Football</title><sub-title lang="en">North Carolina at Pittsburgh</sub-title><desc lang="en">No. 25 Pittsburgh (5-0) hosts North Carolina (2-2). North Carolina fell 37-26 to No. 3 Notre Dame and looks to Billy Edwards Jr. who leads with six TDs. Pittsburgh beat Virginia Tech 35-33 and looks to Holden Geriner who has two TDs this season.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191261_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
