<programme start="20261016123200 +0000" stop="20261016142800 +0000" channel="AMC Thrillers"><title lang="es">Ghost Stories</title><sub-title lang="es">Ghost Stories</sub-title><desc lang="es">A professor investigates three chilling and inexplicable cases related to an abandoned asylum, a car accident and the spirit of an unborn child. Even scarier -- each of the macabre tales seems to have a sinister connection to his own life.</desc><credits><director>Jeremy Dyson</director><actor>Martin Freeman</actor><actor>Andy Nyman</actor><actor>Paul Whitehouse</actor><actor>Alex Lawther</actor><actor>Paul Warren</actor><actor>Kobna Holdbrook-Smith</actor><actor>Nicholas Burns</actor><actor>Louise Atkins</actor></credits><date>19010101</date><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/9a06dab9838ee7286155222f8c6dfd01.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261016142800 +0000" stop="20261016160100 +0000" channel="AMC Thrillers"><title lang="es">Nobody Gets Out Alive</title><sub-title lang="es">Nobody Gets Out Alive</sub-title><desc lang="es">Hunter&apos;s (Brian Gallagher) life turns upside down after his daughter is killed by a drunken driver. He disappears into the woods, and no one sees him for years -- until several partying teenagers are brutally killed one by one.</desc><credits><director>Jason Christopher</director><actor>Brian Gallagher</actor><actor>Shaun Costello</actor><actor>Nikki Bell</actor><actor>David Bonner</actor><actor>Chris Ready</actor><actor>Clint Howard</actor><actor>Joe Gariffo</actor><actor>Jen Dance</actor><actor>Chelsey Garner</actor><actor>Matthew Nadu</actor><actor>Noam Harary</actor></credits><date>20130226</date><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/642c9b501aa94fffca4fbc61b3d4053f.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261016160100 +0000" stop="20261016175500 +0000" channel="AMC Thrillers"><title lang="es">Pay the Ghost</title><sub-title lang="es">Pay the Ghost</sub-title><desc lang="es">Haunted by eerie images and unexplainable messages, a man (Nicolas Cage) tries to unravel the mystery behind the disappearance of his son.</desc><credits><director>Uli Edel</director><actor>Nicolas Cage</actor><actor>Sarah Wayne Callies</actor><actor>Veronica Ferres</actor><actor>Lyriq Bent</actor><actor>Jack Fulton</actor><actor>Elizabeth Le Roux</actor><actor>Sofia Wells</actor><actor>Juan-Carlos Velis</actor></credits><date>20150925</date><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/1f2c4ee29a6e5ac153cf7032c5e0d7d4.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261016175500 +0000" stop="20261016194400 +0000" channel="AMC Thrillers"><title lang="es">The Vigil</title><sub-title lang="es">The Vigil</sub-title><desc lang="es">Terror strikes when an Orthodox Jewish man agrees to watch over the dead body of a community member in a dilapidated Brooklyn home.</desc><credits><director>Keith Thomas</director><actor>Dave Davis</actor><actor>Fred Melamed</actor><actor>Menashe Lustig</actor><actor>Malky Goldman</actor><actor>Lynn Cohen</actor><actor>Nati Rabinowitz</actor><actor>Moshe Lobel</actor></credits><date>20210226</date><rating><value>US_MPAA_PG-13</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/a6db857fcbef9503be5b96f8d78c19fc.jpeg"/></programme>
