<programme start="20261016212800 +0000" stop="20261016232700 +0000" channel="AMC Thrillers"><title lang="es">Birth/Rebirth</title><sub-title lang="es">Birth/Rebirth</sub-title><desc lang="es">A morgue technician reanimates the body of a little girl, but must harvest biological materials from pregnant women to keep her breathing. When the girl&apos;s mother, a nurse, discovers her baby is alive, the two make a dark deal.</desc><credits><director>Laura Moss</director><actor>Judy Reyes</actor><actor>Marin Ireland</actor><actor>Breeda Wool</actor><actor>Monique Curnen</actor><actor>LaChanze</actor><actor>Erica Sweany</actor><actor>Asha Etchison</actor><actor>Rachel Zeiger-Haag</actor></credits><date>20230818</date><rating><value>US_MPAA_R</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/d34de33c0d72b322032aee04effc4c4d.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261016232700 +0000" stop="20261017010500 +0000" channel="AMC Thrillers"><title lang="es">Hellbender</title><sub-title lang="es">Hellbender</sub-title><desc lang="es">A teen and her mother live simply in a home in the woods, spending their time making metal music. A chance encounter with a fellow teen causes her to uncover a connection between her family and witchcraft, which causes a rift with her mother.</desc><credits><actor>Zelda Adams</actor><actor>Toby Poser</actor><actor>Lulu Adams</actor><actor>John Adams</actor><actor>Rinzin Thonden</actor><actor>Khenzom</actor><actor>Shawn Wilson</actor><actor>Rob Figueroa</actor><actor>Tess McKeegan</actor></credits><date>19010101</date><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/572b83908f2fd57fa9c59065e239f98c.jpeg"/></programme>
