<programme start="20261015040100 +0000" stop="20261015043000 +0000" channel="Captain Tsubasa"><title lang="es">Captain Tsubasa LATAM</title><sub-title lang="es">El arma secreta del Musashi</sub-title><desc lang="es">Tsubasa se entera de la enfermedad de Misugi, talento de Musashi, y pierde el deseo de jugar. Molesto, Misugi intentará hacerlo reaccionar.</desc><credits><actor>Oscar Rangel (Kodai Ozora)</actor><actor>Alejandria De Los Santos (Natsuko Ozora)</actor><actor>Oscar Gomez (Tatsuo Mikami)</actor><actor>Jorge Roig JR (Kojiro Hyuga)</actor><actor>Annie Rojas (Taro Misaki)</actor><actor>Ricardo Tejedo (Roberto Hongo)</actor><actor>Carlos Siller (Ryo Ishizaki)</actor><actor>Luis Navarro (Genzo Wakabayashi)</actor><actor>Emilio Ángeles (Tsubasa Ozora)</actor></credits><date>20180813</date><category lang="es">Anime</category><category lang="es">Anime Series</category><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.19.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E20</episode-num><rating><value>PG</value></rating><icon src="https://images.pluto.tv/series/646bcdf917da09001a32ae02/tile_1769546521026.jpg?fill=blur&amp;fit=fill&amp;fm=jpg&amp;h=660&amp;q=75&amp;w=660"/></programme>
