<programme start="20261015123000 +0000" stop="20261015130000 +0000" channel="Crunchyroll 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Danganronpa: The Animation</title><sub-title lang="en">All All Apologies: (Not) Normal Arc</sub-title><desc lang="en">Monokuma admits that he planted a mole and generously offers to let the students know who it is; the rift between the remaining students is worse than before.</desc><credits><director>Seiji Kishi</director><actor>Bryce Papenbrook</actor><actor>Austin Tindle</actor><actor>Caitlin Glass</actor><actor>Carli Mosier</actor><actor>Christopher Bevins</actor></credits><date>20130822</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.7.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E08</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/2bd73c975c8916c2617a6240a92deb0f.jpeg"/></programme>
