<programme start="20261015140000 +0000" stop="20261015143000 +0000" channel="Crunchyroll 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Danganronpa: The Animation</title><sub-title lang="en">The Junk Food of Despair for Racing Through Youth: Not Normal Arc</sub-title><desc lang="en">Naegi and the others find themselves the unwilling participants in an awkward classroom trial; Monokuma seems to be plotting something.</desc><credits><director>Seiji Kishi</director><actor>Bryce Papenbrook</actor><actor>Austin Tindle</actor><actor>Caitlin Glass</actor><actor>Carli Mosier</actor><actor>Christopher Bevins</actor></credits><date>20130912</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.10.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E11</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/f18d75e7b8fadfd52e2ba976c9bb763f.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261015143000 +0000" stop="20261015150000 +0000" channel="Crunchyroll 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Danganronpa: The Animation</title><sub-title lang="en">The Reason Super High School-Level Bad Luck Attracted Super High School-Level Murder ...</sub-title><desc lang="en">Naegi is now almost certain that the principal is not the mastermind, leaving him to question who it could be; he discovers the principal&apos;s digital notebook, filled with vital clues for the trial.</desc><credits><director>Seiji Kishi</director><actor>Bryce Papenbrook</actor><actor>Austin Tindle</actor><actor>Caitlin Glass</actor><actor>Carli Mosier</actor><actor>Christopher Bevins</actor></credits><date>20130919</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.11.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E12</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/997a20dcd71178db5544d4b2371409c7.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261015150000 +0000" stop="20261015153000 +0000" channel="Crunchyroll 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Wonder Egg Priority</title><sub-title lang="en">The Girl Flautist</sub-title><desc lang="en">Ai, Neiru, Rika, and Momoe are quickly becoming close friends as they continue to protect Eggs; however, as they grow closer, questions pile up and tensions rise.</desc><credits><actor>Mikaela Krantz</actor><actor>Dawn Bennett</actor><actor>Anairis Quiñones</actor><actor>Michelle Rojas</actor><actor>Brendan Blaber</actor><actor>Ian Sinclair</actor><actor>Stephen Fu</actor><actor>Suzie Yeung</actor><actor>Felecia Angelle</actor></credits><date>20210210</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.4.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E05</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/78b99b9d96d4b79b086985f6eb6e97ff.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261015153000 +0000" stop="20261015160000 +0000" channel="Crunchyroll 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Wonder Egg Priority</title><sub-title lang="en">Punch Drunk Day</sub-title><desc lang="en">The girls are attacked by a dangerous new type of enemy while trying to protect their Wonder Eggs; Acca and Ura-Acca may have a solution, but Ai is more concerned with the budding relationship between her mother and Mr. Sasaki.</desc><credits><actor>Mikaela Krantz</actor><actor>Dawn Bennett</actor><actor>Anairis Quiñones</actor><actor>Michelle Rojas</actor><actor>Brendan Blaber</actor><actor>Ian Sinclair</actor><actor>Stephen Fu</actor><actor>Suzie Yeung</actor><actor>Felecia Angelle</actor></credits><date>20210217</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.5.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E06</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/36ecb0dee8e1eaab0fdfa906f7455172.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261015160000 +0000" stop="20261015163000 +0000" channel="Crunchyroll 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Wonder Egg Priority</title><sub-title lang="en">After School at 14</sub-title><desc lang="en">It&apos;s Rika&apos;s birthday, and the girls get together to celebrate; Rika, however, is focused on her troubled relationship with her mother, and those worries carry over into her next battle.</desc><credits><actor>Mikaela Krantz</actor><actor>Dawn Bennett</actor><actor>Anairis Quiñones</actor><actor>Michelle Rojas</actor><actor>Brendan Blaber</actor><actor>Ian Sinclair</actor><actor>Stephen Fu</actor><actor>Suzie Yeung</actor><actor>Felecia Angelle</actor></credits><date>20210224</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.6.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E07</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/d0b23691618b05b2fcd259a035ded86f.jpeg"/></programme>
