<programme start="20261015173000 +0000" stop="20261015180000 +0000" channel="Crunchyroll 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Wonder Egg Priority</title><sub-title lang="en">Confession</sub-title><desc lang="en">Ai, Rika and Neiru confront Acca and Ura-Acca, but they are distracted by shocking news from Momoe; later, Momoe faces her toughest battle yet while Ai makes a difficult decision.</desc><credits><actor>Mikaela Krantz</actor><actor>Dawn Bennett</actor><actor>Anairis Quiñones</actor><actor>Michelle Rojas</actor><actor>Brendan Blaber</actor><actor>Ian Sinclair</actor><actor>Stephen Fu</actor><actor>Suzie Yeung</actor><actor>Felecia Angelle</actor></credits><date>20210317</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.9.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E10</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/9d96d16ad0feccabebd04b25a12e844f.jpeg"/></programme>
