<programme start="20261016010000 +0000" stop="20261016030000 +0000" channel="NBC Sports Network"><title lang="en">Premier League Soccer</title><sub-title lang="en">Chelsea vs. Bournemouth</sub-title><desc lang="en">Chelsea (2-1-2) hosts Bournemouth (0-3-2) at Stamford Bridge in the Premier League. Chelsea arrives 10th after five games following a 3-0 loss at Brentford. Bournemouth, 17th, has drawn three of five meetings here - including a 2-2 draw in December.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Soccer</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p3605402_b_v12_bj.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261016030000 +0000" stop="20261016063000 +0000" channel="NBC Sports Network"><title lang="en">College Football</title><sub-title lang="en">Stanford at Notre Dame</sub-title><desc lang="en">No.3 Notre Dame hosts Stanford at Notre Dame Stadium in their annual rivalry clash in Week 6 play. Notre Dame enters after a 37-26 win led by CJ Carr&apos;s four passing touchdowns, while Stanford looks to rebound after a 57-3 pounding by Wake Forest.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191261_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261016063000 +0000" stop="20261016100000 +0000" channel="NBC Sports Network"><title lang="en">College Football</title><sub-title lang="en">USC at Penn State</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Penn State Nittany Lions host the No. 19 USC Trojans in Big Ten play. Penn State counts on Rocco Becht following his 243 passing yards in the Oct 3 game, while USC counts on Jayden Maiava after leading a recent 25-21 win over Washington.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191261_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
