<programme start="20261014180000 +0000" stop="20261014210000 +0000" channel="NFL Network"><title lang="en">NFL Football</title><sub-title lang="en">New York Giants at Washington Commanders</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Washington Commanders host the New York Giants in NFL Week 5 at Northwest Stadium. The Giants lead the NFC East and have won three of their last four games, but Washington has taken four of the last five meetings between these division rivals.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191277_b_v12_ah.jpg"/></programme>
