<programme start="20261015000000 +0000" stop="20261015030000 +0000" channel="NFL Network"><title lang="en">NFL Football</title><sub-title lang="en">Philadelphia Eagles vs. Jacksonville Jaguars</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Philadelphia Eagles face the Jacksonville Jaguars at Tottenham Hotspur in London for NFL Week 5. Philadelphia seeks to halt a two-game slide after a 24-20 loss to Los Angeles, while 3-1 Jacksonville enters behind quarterback Trevor Lawrence.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191277_b_v12_ah.jpg"/></programme>
