<programme start="20261015050000 +0000" stop="20261015080000 +0000" channel="NFL Network"><title lang="en">NFL Football</title><sub-title lang="en">Buffalo Bills at Los Angeles Rams</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Rams host the Bills at SoFi Stadium. Buffalo lost its previous game to New England 29-26, while the Rams have alternated wins and losses. The Rams rely on Matthew Stafford, who has six touchdowns; Buffalo looks to Josh Allen, who has six as well.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191277_b_v12_ah.jpg"/></programme>
