<programme start="20261014160000 +0000" stop="20261014180000 +0000" channel="NHL Network"><title lang="en">NHL Hockey</title><sub-title lang="en">Edmonton Oilers at Los Angeles Kings</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Los Angeles Kings host the Edmonton Oilers for a Pacific Division showdown at crypto.com Arena. Center Connor McDavid leads Edmonton in points and assists, while left winger Artemi Panarin leads Los Angeles in points and goals.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Hockey</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191278_b_v12_aa.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261014180000 +0000" stop="20261014200000 +0000" channel="NHL Network"><title lang="en">NHL Hockey</title><sub-title lang="en">Calgary Flames at Anaheim Ducks</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Anaheim Ducks host the Calgary Flames for a Pacific Division matchup at Honda Center. Calgary sits in the bottom of the division standings with Joel Farabee leading in points and assists. Leo Carlsson also leads the Ducks in points and assists.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Hockey</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191278_b_v12_aa.jpg"/></programme>
